# Live site changes

The owner must know before anything on the live website changes.

- Do not deploy, publish, or edit production data, Cloudflare settings, admin accounts, or DNS unless the owner explicitly asks for that change in the current request.
- Do not put the admin password in source code, public pages, Git, or chat logs that get committed.
- Do not create another admin account. Public signup always stays a normal user.
- Reading the repository is not permission to change the published site.
